{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/392200c199d2dadc0307e5769eacad76.poster.avif?t=1774268164\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/392200c199d2dadc0307e5769eacad76.webm?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/392200c199d2dadc0307e5769eacad76.mp4?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TURN GRIME INTO SHINE - AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a long-forgotten fridge and become a <strong>true sanitation hero</strong>!  In this meditative arcade game, you control a guy with a pressure stream to clean off mold that has taken over food, shelves, drawers and even the freezer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/f46aeb4458bcbaafe6846685663d845d.poster.avif?t=1774268164\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/f46aeb4458bcbaafe6846685663d845d.webm?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/f46aeb4458bcbaafe6846685663d845d.mp4?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pressure-Powered Gameplay</strong> -\u00a0Aim, spray, and swap cleaning modes. Blast away mold, shoo back pesky enemies, and leave sparkling cleanliness behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the Best Tool</strong> \u2013 Wield a pressure washer, leaf blower, axe, and more to tackle stubborn grime across the kitchen. Adapt your approach and level up each tool to boost your skills and make your gear even more powerful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Locations</strong> -\u00a0From cluttered kitchens to treasure piles and spooky sewers, every corner hides something to scrub. Make your kitchen shine and peek behind jars in the fridge \u2014 you never know what you can find there!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/a89b4fbfef30ed1463e31032cd28040b.poster.avif?t=1774268164\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/a89b4fbfef30ed1463e31032cd28040b.webm?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/a89b4fbfef30ed1463e31032cd28040b.mp4?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange &amp; Sticky Foes</strong> -\u00a0Tackle colorful, iridescent, ghostly, crystalline, and even mimic molds, each with unique behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Food Heroes</strong> - You're not a knight or soldier, you\u2019re a healthy meal on a mission. Play as sensible meals determined to defeat mold and stay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong> \u2013 Earn new heroes, audio tracks, and cosmetic items to personalize your basement.\u00a0Cash in your points for shinier and stronger gear at the store\u2014because clean heroes deserves style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Addictive</strong> -<strong>\u00a0</strong>A chill soundtrack and satisfying cleaning sounds make every spray extremely calming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/45303b89d35312a06105f7b904c2e8e8.poster.avif?t=1774268164\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/45303b89d35312a06105f7b904c2e8e8.webm?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/45303b89d35312a06105f7b904c2e8e8.mp4?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688130?t=1774268164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688130?t=1774268164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/8cac010171468c7f1823d7281a698a68f2e9c703/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1774268164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/8cac010171468c7f1823d7281a698a68f2e9c703/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1774268164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4327990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN MOLDWASHER COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_