 \u2013 Earn new heroes, audio tracks, and cosmetic items to personalize your basement.\u00a0Cash in your points for shinier and stronger gear at the store\u2014because clean heroes deserves style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Addictive</strong> -<strong>\u00a0</strong>A chill soundtrack and satisfying cleaning sounds make every spray extremely calming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/45303b89d35312a06105f7b904c2e8e8.poster.avif?t=1774268164\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/45303b89d35312a06105f7b904c2e8e8.webm?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/extras/45303b89d35312a06105f7b904c2e8e8.mp4?t=1774268164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Rubel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688130/31c2c29bc3fd72fdadcb670dbae9358058bab684/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1774268164","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688130/2121759100/c402c6a17c90cb7741f302af305651f2f58fa94d/1774266977/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774268163","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688130/2121759100/c402c6a17c90cb7741f302af305651f2f58fa94d/1774266977/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774268163","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688130/2121759100/c402c6a17c90cb7741f302af305651f2f58fa94d/1774266977/hls_264_master.m3u8?